    "lines": [
      "Morning all. Hard hats on, mugs out, permits signed. In that order.",
      "The crane is not a coat hook. I will not be saying this again.",
      "Not on the programme? Not happening. Unless it rains.",
      "Delivery's due at nine. So, realistically, about half past two.",
      "Measure twice, cut once, and fill in the form three times.",
      "Toolbox talk at ten. There will be biscuits, and there will be a quiz."
    ]
  },
  "receptionist": {
    "name": "Joy Adeyemi",
    "look": {
      "head": "receptionist",
