    "lines": [
      "Morning! Sign in here, hat from the rack, and mind the puddle.",
      "Visitor badges are orange. Hard hats are white. Don't swap them.",
      "Boots off the clean mat, if you love me.",
      "The delivery driver is lost again. I've sent him the pin twice.",
      "Hollowmere Builders, Quarry Lane gatehouse. Yes, it's muddy."
    ]
